Skip launcher tests that require an Isaac Lab source checkout.

The test_launcher_* cases copy the real isaaclab.sh launcher from
ISAACLAB_ROOT, which only exists in a source checkout and is not shipped
by the installed (wheel/conda) package. Gate them on the existing
source_checkout_root session fixture (added upstream in isaac-sim/IsaacLab#7389)
so they auto-skip when run against an installed package, mirroring the other
checkout-only tests. Upstreamable as-is.
diff --git a/source/isaaclab/test/cli/test_env_commands.py b/source/isaaclab/test/cli/test_env_commands.py
